## CORE POLICY SECTIONS

### 1. PURPOSE
**Structure:**
- Single paragraph stating policy objective
- Clear explanation of what the policy governs
- Link to compliance requirements (regulations, standards)

**Template:**
"This [Policy Name] establishes the framework for [specific domain]. The policy ensures that [key objective] in compliance with [relevant regulations/standards]."

---

### 2. SCOPE
**Structure:**
- Bulleted list of who/what the policy applies to
- Include: personnel, systems, data types, locations, third parties

**Template:**
"This policy applies to:
- [Stakeholder group 1]
- [Stakeholder group 2]
- [System/asset type 1]
- [System/asset type 2]
- [Geographic/operational scope]"

---

### 3. ROLES AND RESPONSIBILITIES
**Structure:**
- Subsections for each key role
- 3-5 specific responsibilities per role
- Align roles with organization structure

**Template:**
"### 3.1 [Role Title - e.g., Executive Leadership]
- [Accountability statement]
- [Approval authority]
- [Review responsibility]

### 3.2 [Role Title - e.g., Technical Team]
